      "blurb": "Lessons in Perspective is an interactive, web-based poetry collection that explores how every relationship is shaped by the ones that came before it. Built with React and Three.js, this collection makes the browser a space for 3D concrete poetry. Your interaction with the present can unravel the past, illustrating connections that are invisible but felt. Lessons in Perspective offers a poetic meditation on love, memory, and the invisible architectures of life.",
